Q('obs',1,'Which network of automated airport weather stations is the main surface observing system in the United States?','ASOS','NEXRAD','GOES','ACARS','ASOS (Automated Surface Observing System) reports temperature, wind, pressure, visibility and more, mostly at airports.')
