Q('obs',3,'Why is storm relative motion useful for finding tornado rotation?','It removes the storm\'s own movement so rotation stands out','It measures rainfall rate more accurately','It shows only the lowest cloud heights','It filters out hail','Subtracting the storm motion reveals the inbound and outbound pattern of rotation.')
