Q('obs',3,'A forecaster wants to know winds at many heights directly over a radar site. Which product answers this?','Wind profile','Composite reflectivity','Correlation coefficient','Visible imagery','A velocity azimuth display style wind profile lists wind by height above the radar.')
Q('obs',2,'Commercial airplanes help weather forecasting by…','Reporting temperature and wind along their flight path','Dropping balloons','Measuring ocean temperature','Launching sensors every hour','Aircraft observations add data aloft where few other measurements exist.')
