Q('maps',2,'In a METAR, what does 18018G28KT mean?','Wind from 180° at 18 kt gusting 28 kt','Wind toward 180° at 28 kt','Wind from 18° at 180 kt','Visibility 18 miles in a 28 kt storm','Group order is direction (3 digits), speed, G gust, KT knots.')
Q('maps',2,'In a METAR, what does BKN040 mean?','Broken clouds at 4,000 ft','Broken clouds at 40 ft','Scattered clouds at 4,000 ft','Overcast at 400 ft','BKN is 5–7 eighths. Height is in hundreds of feet.')
