Q('maps',2,'In a METAR, A2992 is the…','Altimeter setting 29.92 inHg','Wind gust of 29.92 kt','Temperature 29.2 °C','Cloud height 2,992 ft','A followed by four digits gives pressure in inches of mercury.')
