Q('maps',3,'A METAR lists wind 24025G40KT and BKN015CB. What hazard does CB point to?','Cumulonimbus with possible storms and gusts','Cirrus with fair weather','Fog at the surface','A weak sea breeze','CB means cumulonimbus (towering convection).')
