Q('upper',1,'Which pressure level is usually used to locate the jet stream?','300 mb','850 mb','700 mb','1000 mb','300 mb is near the jet stream level.')
Q('upper',2,'Which level best shows low-level moisture and temperature?','850 mb','500 mb','300 mb','200 mb','850 mb is about 1.5 km above ground.')
Q('upper',2,'Troughs and ridges are usually read on which upper-air chart?','500 mb','1000 mb','Surface','850 mb','500 mb shows the mid-level wave pattern.')
