Q('upper',3,'A steep temperature line (cooling fast with height) indicates…','Unstable air','Stable air','An inversion','A warm front','Rapid cooling with height favors rising parcels.')
Q('upper',2,'Skew-T diagrams differ from Stüve diagrams mainly because…','Their temperature lines are tilted to spread curves apart','They show rainfall instead of temperature','They only cover the surface','They have no wind barbs','The reading skills are the same; the axes are skewed.')
