Q('upper',3,'A forecaster sees very high CAPE but no wind shear and no trigger. What is the best conclusion?','Storms are possible but may not become organized or even start','Supercells are certain','No instability exists','A derecho is certain','CAPE is fuel but shear and lift are also needed.')
Q('upper',3,'A dry parcel lifted 2 km from 24 °C (no condensation) will have a temperature near…','4 °C','11 °C','22 °C','14 °C','Dry adiabatic cooling is about 10 °C per km.')
# ---- setup
Q('setup',1,'Which four ingredients are usually needed for supercell thunderstorms?','Moisture, instability, lift and wind shear','Moisture, stability, haze and calm wind','Dry air, a cap, cold ground and a front','High pressure, clear skies, calm wind and fog','Fuel, a trigger and organized wind make strong storms.')
