Q('setup',3,'Why does strong directional shear matter for tornado-producing storms?','It helps the updraft begin to rotate','It cools the cloud base','It dries the lower air','It slows the storm to a stop','Turning winds produce horizontal spin that tilts into a rotating updraft.')
