Q('setup',3,'Cold, dry air from Canada meets warm, moist Gulf air over the Plains. What is the main result?','Strong contrast that favors fronts and severe storms','Calm clear weather','A stable cap everywhere','Immediate hurricanes','Contrasting air masses with a trigger are the classic recipe.')
